OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle house blaze in
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have urged people to avoid
OL,7,Fpart of a village after a blaze in a
OL,8,Fterraced house in the early hours of
OL,9,Fthe morning.
OL,11,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid four fire engines were sent to
OL,13,Ftackle the blaze in The Sands in
OL,14,FAshington, near Pulborough, just after
OL,15,F02:00 GMT.
OL,17,FA fire service spokesperson said no
OL,18,Fcasualties were reported, and that it
OL,19,Fhad returned to reinspect the site at
OL,20,Fabout 07:45 GMT and found no further
OL,21,Fsigns of fire.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
