OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle house blaze in
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople were advised to avoid the area,
OL,7,Fand nearby residents were also urged to
OL,8,Fclose their windows and doors to avoid
OL,9,Fsmoke, a spokesperson said on social
OL,10,Fmedia.
